# Explore: {feature}

## Status: Draft

## Codebase Overview

- **Stack & Architecture:** Describe the tech stack and overall architecture of the relevant area.
- **Key files:** Files and directories relevant to the feature.
- **Entry points:** Main entry points of the affected flow.

## Patterns Found

- **Pattern 1:** Pattern name — Location in code (file:line).
- **Pattern 2:** Pattern name — Location in code (file:line).

## Dependencies & Risks

- **Dependency 1:** Description of external/internal dependency and how it affects the feature.
- **Risk 1:** Identified risk with level (high/medium/low) and proposed mitigation.

## Recommendations

- **Recommendation 1:** Recommended action with clear rationale.
